    "title": "Meme Shooter in Sandbox Mods",
    "description": "Meme Shooter in Sandbox Mods is a multiplayer FPS shooter game - where you hunt and destroy other memes or cartoon characters. Players will be taken to a simulated environment such as a maze or circus. What you need to do with your teammates is collect weapons and equipment to prepare for the battle of survival. Only one side can be the winner \ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\r\n\r\nIn addition, players can role-play funny memes to hunt other players. Free to create in Sandbox Mods mode. Whether you are a meme or hunter, this game will bring moments of extreme tension and drama. Stimulates the mind, raises adrenaline levels and gives you the ultimate satisfaction of winning! Let's try your best now!!! \ud83d\udcaf\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcaa HOW TO PLAY \r\n\ud83d\udd25 Choose a map, join the battle with other players\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Collect weapons and equipment such as guns, armor and jetpacks\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Avoid and destroy memes and other cartoon characters\r\n\ud83d\udd25 You can change the mode to transform into a meme to hunt for players\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcab FEATURES\r\n\ud83c\udf89 Many interesting and complex Sandbox Mods maps to challenge players\r\n\ud83c\udf89 Two flexible modes to change sides \r\n\ud83c\udf89 Smooth 3D gameplay\r\n\ud83c\udf89 Support items helps winning\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Download Meme Shooter in Sandbox Mods now for a satisfying victory!!! \u2694\ufe0f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\udd25",
